<title>UK: World Bank raises 1.0 bln Czech crowns via note.</title>
<headline>World Bank raises 1.0 bln Czech crowns via note.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank has raised 1.0 billion Czech crowns via a one-year note, sole lead manager Hambros Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal, a block trade, paid a 13.375 percent coupon and was issued at 100.80. Fees totalled one percent. The payment date is September 8, 1997.</p>
<p>The World Bank is rated AAA by Moody's Investors Service and Standard &amp; Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
